@startuml state_machine_async_job
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #EBF5FB

title State Machine: Async Job (BullMQ / Broker State)

[*] --> QUEUED : enqueue job

state QUEUED : job persisted in queue\nwaiting for a worker
QUEUED --> RUNNING : worker acquired job
QUEUED --> CANCELLED : cancelled before start

state RUNNING : worker processing\nwith heartbeat / progress
RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED : completed successfully
RUNNING --> RETRYING : failed but retryable
RUNNING --> FAILED : non-retryable failure\nor retry budget exhausted
RUNNING --> CANCELLED : cancel requested

state RETRYING : awaiting retry with\nexponential backoff
RETRYING --> RUNNING : retry attempt
RETRYING --> DEAD_LETTER : max retry exceeded
RETRYING --> CANCELLED : cancel retry

state SUCCEEDED : business side-effects complete\nor event published
SUCCEEDED --> [*]

state FAILED : terminal failure\npersist error detail
FAILED --> DEAD_LETTER : move to debug queue
FAILED --> QUEUED : manual requeue

state DEAD_LETTER : retain payload / error for debug\nnot auto-retried
DEAD_LETTER --> QUEUED : engineer requeue
DEAD_LETTER --> [*] : archive / discard

state CANCELLED : intentionally cancelled\nno auto retry
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of RETRYING
  Default retry policy:
  3 attempts, exponential backoff
  1s -> 2s -> 4s.
end note

note right of DEAD_LETTER
  DEAD_LETTER is decoupled from business state.
  Document / video still keeps last_error
  so instructor or engineer can act on it.
end note

@enduml
